## Policy

Human-owned. `deps-check` parses the Rules, Verification and Smoke tables and the Delivery list: keep their columns.
Rules: `never-auto` (never touched; always a human decision) · `hold` (no bump until Review by) · `hold-major` (patch and
minor only) · `cap` (Value = highest allowed range, e.g. `<7`) · `pin` (keep saved exact) · `group` (Value = group name;
bumped together) · `min-age` (Value = days a release must age; security fixes skip it).

